  "caption": "Save this before you go to Bangkok. Unpopular opinion: Wat Arun beats the Grand Palace. 👇\n\nThree days that beat the crowds: the Grand Palace at opening with shoulders and knees covered, the Jim Thompson House (guided tour only, included in the ticket), and a sunset slot at King Power Mahanakhon booked ahead.\n\nUrban Tales plans your trip in a minute and tells you the story of every stop as you walk.\n.\n.\n.\n#bangkok #thailand #thailandtravel #traveltips #urbantales",
  "dm": "Bangkok · 3 days\nDay 1: Grand Palace at opening → City Pillar Shrine → ferry to Wat Arun → Chinatown (Yaowarat) at dusk\nDay 2: Ratchaprasong Skywalk → centralwOrld → Jim Thompson House → Victory Monument\nDay 3: ICONSIAM → Wat Traimit → Lumphini Park → King Power Mahanakhon → Asiatique\nTip: no sleeveless tops or shorts at the Grand Palace."
 },
 "es": {
